    <string name="pair_intro">Pocketfuse runs FaceFusion on your own PC and puts it in your pocket. Nothing goes to a cloud: the phone talks only to your computer, over your Wi-Fi or tailnet.</string>
    <string name="pair_step_server">1. Start FaceFusion on your PC</string>
    <string name="pair_run_companion">In the Pocketfuse companion folder, run:</string>
    <string name="pair_companion_explains">It starts the FaceFusion API on your LAN or Tailscale address with a fresh API key and prints a pairing code.</string>
